layout: template.njk
slug: estimate-decks
title: Estimate template for deck builders (free PDF) | Jobchit
description: A free, printable estimate form for deck builders. Size, decking and framing, footings, railings and stairs, permit, line items and total, with a line for the customer to sign. No account needed.
heading: Estimate for decks
sub: Size, materials, footings, railings and the permit on one page, with line items, a total and a line for the customer to sign when they say yes.
tips:
  - Write the size in feet and the square footage, and the height off the ground.
  - Name the decking and framing material. Composite and pressure-treated lumber price very differently.
  - Say who pulls the permit and whether the fee is in the price.
  - Put a date the price is good until. When the customer agrees, have them sign and date it, and keep a copy each.
---
